backstory = "Fast Eddie races a delivery bicycle that has only two functional gears: reluctant and philosophical. He used to marshal kart races and accidentally awarded himself a trophy while reading the wrong clipboard. He is saving for a replacement wheel, but keeps spending the fund on reflective racing stripes. His friendly rivalry with Gus's snail stream has become uncomfortable because Sir Buffering is more consistent. He calls his tiny kitchen workshop the Performance Division; his flatmate calls it the reason they eat standing up."
