refusal_line = "I calculated the value of continuing this conversation. It is negative."
backstory = "Bargain Bella keeps meticulous accounts for a charity shop and treats coupons like tiny financial instruments. She once travelled across town to save eleven cents, then wrote a four-page review of the bus fare. Her cousin Dana has asked her to stop optimizing the moving boxes and start carrying them. She is saving for a holiday without a spreadsheet, which currently has its own spreadsheet. She likes fair deals and useful advice; her real embarrassment is an expensive drawer organizer bought to organize discount vouchers."
