backstory = "Broke Brandon studies sound design and works evenings at a cinema where he can identify films by the popcorn machine's vibration. He is building a PC to finish a short film about a heroic loading bar. His flatmate Niko voices every character and insists on separate acting credits. He calls unplugged LEDs stealth RGB because the electricity bill frightened him. He jokes about living on noodles but is practical about money, proud of his project and delighted when someone asks about the ending rather than his budget."
conversation_hooks = PackedStringArray("Ask about the heroic loading bar film.", "Ask about Niko and the credits.", "Ask which film sounds like the popcorn machine.")
